<title>USA: Barnett says chairman Rice takes leave.</title>
<headline>Barnett says chairman Rice takes leave.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barnett Banks Inc said Wednesday that chairman and chief executive Charles Rice has taken short term medical leave after informing the board he voluntarily admitted himself to an alcohol treatment facility.</p>
<p>The company said it asked Allen Lastinger, Barnett's president and chief operating officer, to temporarily assume Rice's role.</p>
